{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 49","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f642cbbd390b4882363ab6b5c2906dbf6be6cc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/f/f6fd3f061e31dee7cfd494078b4a8942eae979d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,5),(2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/6/c0658fa5f64bbe8fbe318420d63186079e262dc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> respectively. \nThe value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> that makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eacd7911343586730ff77d6d90ab0559d14e683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}+\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" /> as small as possible is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408efb93b5578befbf701f6fd805704c66cea72d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\frac{6}{7} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\frac{5}{6}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"400\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" /> be the reflection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> over the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-axis. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" /> has coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbbbc7234bbfe7a4675c4945bc9d7d269ca13b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee24c12f7cf53669f367a7e8ab0cbac83c54c590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;C = AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/0/a309627f09bc0b63d7719c56e65169c7c89dea2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;C+BC=AC+BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />. By the triangle inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b5aaf336ea5136b81c4d166bef89c0361ab5123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;C+BC \\geq A&#39;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />, with equality happening when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce426fec225fb71df834c39d77173ef433e6329c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${A&#39;B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22cf0fa25e560981109abb13757436b94fadb035.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;B$\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>The slope of line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22cf0fa25e560981109abb13757436b94fadb035.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;B$\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d80858113d9b9886f40760d81cc7d414684c2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1-5}{2-(-5)}=-\\frac {4}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"126\" height=\"43\" />. In point-slope form, the equation of this line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/638ad5f5234222c4ff3ff63d701c8be85d9debf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-5=-\\frac {4}{7}(x+5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"38\" />, which becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c287973a3d2682fa471c240cb667f05b32cebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{4}{7}x + \\frac{15}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" /> when converted to slope-intercept form.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/006814bd0cb6d22aef20cada7529a9e2db14a3cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\frac{15}{7} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 2\\frac17}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"155\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">Problem 50</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=19