le=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style